OL,3,AOff Campus star collaboration 'gave me
OL,4,Achills', says Babydoll singer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe singer behind the TikTok viral hit
OL,7,FBabydoll says collaborating with an Off
OL,8,FCampus star was "mind-boggling".
OL,10,FJamie Miller, who is originally from
OL,11,FPontprennau in Cardiff, was close to
OL,12,Fcalling it quits on his music career at
OL,13,Fthe start of 2026, deciding it was his
OL,14,F"last chance", financially and
OL,15,Femotionally.
OL,17,FBut over the summer everything changed
OL,18,Fwhen Babydoll caught the attention of
OL,19,Fpeople on social media, leading to a
OL,20,Fviral dance, his first UK top 10
OL,21,Fsingle, and reaching number one in the
OL,22,FUS iTunes pop chart.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
